Filename: {pf}\MySQL\MySQL Server 5.1\bin\mysql; Parameters: "-u root -pmasterkey --execute=""source {tmp}\dumpNutWin.sql"""; WorkingDir: {tmp}; StatusMsg: Gerando Base de dados e Registros; Flags: waituntilterminated runhidden
